WEBVTT

00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:08.133
You don't even need to dictate for this one. Watch!

00:00:10.867 --> 00:00:13.367
New workflow, then choose Translation.

00:00:16.567 --> 00:00:18.867
Apple Translate runs right on your Mac.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:19.967
Pick your language.

00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:24.400
Hotkey, Process Selected Text, and record a shortcut.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:32.567
Save it.

00:00:36.433 --> 00:00:37.867
A message in German?

00:00:37.867 --> 00:00:38.933
Just select it.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.200
One shortcut, and it's English.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:48.633
Works in any app, with any workflow.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.100
Select, press the shortcut, and it's translated!
